    "scr_dup": "006",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>3. Others</div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>﻿﻿﻿Poster presentation: Students will make poster and give presentation as a pair in between Week 8 to 9. Details about conducting the poster presentation are at the discretion of each individual teacher.</li>\n\t<li>﻿﻿﻿Final Examination Regulations: Students requiring a make-up examination must submit a formal application, in strict accordance with university regulations, within 3 calendar days following the scheduled examination date. Any student absent on the date of the examination who fails to file such an application shall receive a final examination grade of 0. The grade for an approved make-up examination will be based on the actual score achieved. However, in accordance with the Center&#39;s regulations, if the absence is without a valid excuse (as defined under Article 26 of the University Academic Regulations), the recorded grade shall be 80% of the actual mark obtained.</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Be on time. 請準時上課。\n\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n\n3. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected durati on.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。\n\n4. Please purchase the original textbook, following intellectual property law. 請購買正版課本，請勿使用複製版本。\n\n5. The texts and exercises will be completed in class. Please bring textbooks to class. 請上課攜帶課本，以利上課活動使用。\n\n6. Follow the school rules to apply for a make-up exam within three days of the exam date. Relevant documents are required for the application. No-shows or those with late application will receive ZERO. The date of a make-up exam will be arranged by the instructor. 若須要補考的同學，請遵照學校的補考規定，在考試後的3天內提出申請。若考試當天沒有出現或者是沒有申請補考的同學，考試成績一律0分。\n\n7. Following the FCU Exam Regulations, cheaters will receive ZERO for their exams and such cases will be reviewed by the Student Reward and Disciplinary Committee. 考試請遵照考場規定，若作弊者以0分計算。",
